"sākas ar šo skaidro darbību."

#: includes/class-ymulti-launch-center.php:139
msgid ""
"This bar measures the installed site. Official Plugin Check and the live "
"Autopilot/security acceptance sequence remain separate release evidence."
msgstr ""
"Šī josla mēra instalēto vietni. Oficiālais Plugin Check un tiešā "
"Autopilota/drošības pieņemšanas secība paliek atsevišķi laidiena pierādījumi."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin.php:909
msgid ""
"This bar tracks the listed 1.16.0–1.20.0 delivery milestones. Overall product"
" readiness, production acceptance and competitive parity use separate "
"evidence."
